1
00:00:00,666 --> 00:00:02,066
(Penny:)You're the best dad ever.

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:05,567
(Penny's Dad:)Yeah. Uh, hold that thought.

3
00:00:05,571 --> 00:00:07,901
(Penny's Dad:)I've been sitting
on a little news myself.

4
00:00:07,906 --> 00:00:09,536
(Penny:)Well, what is it?

5
00:00:09,541 --> 00:00:12,711
(Penny's Dad:)You know that rototiller
I got for the tractor?

6
00:00:12,711 --> 00:00:13,781
(Sheldon:)No.

7
00:00:13,779 --> 00:00:14,809
(Penny's Dad:)Oh, you should see it.

8
00:00:14,813 --> 00:00:17,483
(Penny's Dad:)It is a beautiful
piece of machinery.

9
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:20,213
(Penny's Dad:)Anyway, uh...

10
00:00:20,219 --> 00:00:23,189
(Penny's Dad:)I backed over
your pet pig with it.

11
00:00:23,188 --> 00:00:25,688
(Penny:)Moondance?

12
00:00:25,691 --> 00:00:28,921
(Penny's Dad:)Yeah, he's, uh,
not dancing anymore.

13
00:00:28,927 --> 00:00:30,897
(Penny:)You killed my pig?

14
00:00:31,929 --> 00:00:33,129
(Penny's Dad:)I did not kill him.

15
00:00:33,132 --> 00:00:35,462
(Penny's Dad:)The vet took care of that.

16
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:37,197
(Penny's Dad:)When?

17
00:00:37,202 --> 00:00:40,272
Oh... ten, 12 months ago.

18
00:00:41,606 --> 00:00:42,976
You didn't tell me for a year?!

19
00:00:42,975 --> 00:00:45,445
(Penny's Dad:)Well, apple doesn't fall far
from the tree, does it?

20
00:00:46,477 --> 00:00:47,647
(Penny's Dad:)Love ya, slugger.

21
00:00:47,646 --> 00:00:49,316
Gotta go!

22
00:00:51,749 --> 00:00:53,949
(Bernadette:)Okay, Amy, your turn.

23
00:00:56,754 --> 00:00:58,454
(grunting)

24
00:00:58,457 --> 00:01:03,027
(breathing rhythmically)

